      455.79,
      496.12,
      481.13
    ],
    "text": "THE ANNUAL POSON PERAHARA FESTIVAL OF THEHISTORICALLY SIGNIFICANT DEEGAWAPIYA RAJAMAHA VIHARAYA \u2013 2025",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      492.79,
      549.7,
      518.13
    ],
    "text": "The Poson Perahara Festival organized annually by the Deegawapi Rajamaha Viharaya located in the Addalaichenai Divisional Secretariat of the Ampara District in the Eastern Province, will take place on June 11, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      534.79,
      549.69,
      574.13
    ],
    "text": "The attention of the General Public is drawn in terms of the provisions of the Pilgrimage Ordinance to the Standing Regulations in the Government Gazette No. 13529 of 22nd February, 1963 which will be in force during the pilgrimage season.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
